{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_01AD10FF","title":"Get Recipe from Marius Mitchell","entry":"Dlg_01AD10FF::entry","exit":"Dlg_01AD10FF::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_B54BDBF7","articyId":"72057718591982298","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marius Mitchell","text":"Hey there. We just got a fresh shipment of powder mulch in, if that's your bag?","speakerId":"Ntt_5511B403","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hey there. We just got a fresh shipment of powder mulch in, if that's your bag?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":50.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"46731","byteOffset":32010896,"byteLength":424}},{"id":"DFr_83ECCCCA","articyId":"72057718591982312","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marius Mitchell","text":"Oh, it's a staple here. Really adds that little extra umami.","speakerId":"Ntt_5511B403","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Oh, it's a staple here. Really adds that little extra umami.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":650.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31800","byteOffset":19910528,"byteLength":404}},{"id":"DFr_0BB6596C","articyId":"72057718591982359","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marius Mitchell","text":"Hey, we do what we can here. LUZ restrictions make shipments difficult, but sometimes limitations are the key to inspiration.","speakerId":"Ntt_5511B403","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hey, we do what we can here. LUZ restrictions make shipments difficult, but sometimes limitations are the key to inspiration.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":1550.0,"y":175.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32340","byteOffset":20117176,"byteLength":436}},{"id":"DFr_6B951358","articyId":"72057718591982366","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marius Mitchell","text":"Look, until you run your own place I'd keep those kinds of opinions to yourself.","speakerId":"Ntt_5511B403","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Look, until you run your own place I'd keep those kinds of opinions to yourself.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":1575.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32226","byteOffset":20071512,"byteLength":424}},{"id":"DFr_947C81A9","articyId":"72057718591982393","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marius Mitchell","text":"It's not as simple as it looks on the holos. Managing your own joint comes with a lot of baggage.","speakerId":"Ntt_5511B403","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It's not as simple as it looks on the holos. Managing your own joint comes with a lot of baggage.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":2175.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44800","byteOffset":31282736,"byteLength":408}},{"id":"DFr_14C3D2FA","articyId":"72057718591982400","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marius Mitchell","text":"And you're in here sniffing for recipes? Not on my watch bucko. Get lost.","speakerId":"Ntt_5511B403","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"And you're in here sniffing for recipes? Not on my watch bucko. Get lost.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":2425.0,"y":725.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35129","byteOffset":25651000,"byteLength":432}},{"id":"DFr_27B4F822","articyId":"72057718591982408","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marius Mitchell","text":"Well firstly... wait, you're not in the business are you? Wouldn't want to be handing out trade secrets to the competition!","speakerId":"Ntt_5511B403","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well firstly... wait, you're not in the business are you? Wouldn't want to be handing out trade secrets to the competition!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":2175.0,"y":175.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33260","byteOffset":20467272,"byteLength":468}},{"id":"DFr_A9483259","articyId":"72057718591982433","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marius Mitchell","text":"I appreciate that friend.","speakerId":"Ntt_5511B403","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I appreciate that friend.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":3075.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28298","byteOffset":18587944,"byteLength":336}},{"id":"DFr_97E5465D","articyId":"72057718591982466","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marius Mitchell","text":"Look man, I appreciate the honesty but I can't be giving out the good stuff to the competition. It's hard enough out here as it is.","speakerId":"Ntt_5511B403","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Look man, I appreciate the honesty but I can't be giving out the good stuff to the competition. It's hard enough out here as it is.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":3325.0,"y":-275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37858","byteOffset":28657600,"byteLength":488}},{"id":"DFr_1A433DED","articyId":"72057718591982473","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marius Mitchell","text":"You sure? My business lives or dies on this stuff so I can't be letting it get into the wrong hands.","speakerId":"Ntt_5511B403","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You sure? My business lives or dies on this stuff so I can't be letting it get into the wrong hands.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":2750.0,"y":175.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18985","byteOffset":15069288,"byteLength":444}},{"id":"DFr_AB2FD0F7","articyId":"72057718591982506","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Marius Mitchell","text":"Ok that sounds fine. Here you go. It's a best-seller here!","speakerId":"Ntt_5511B403","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ok that sounds fine. Here you go. It's a best-seller here!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":3650.0,"y":175.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24983","byteOffset":17331648,"byteLength":368}},{"id":"DFr_FFAB0C95","articyId":"72057718591982305","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I've never cooked with that.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I've never cooked with that.","TextSheVersion":"I've never cooked with that.","TextTheyVersion":"I've never cooked with that."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":350.0,"y":200.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20396","byteOffset":15599176,"byteLength":308}},{"id":"DFr_13EC261A","articyId":"72057718591982319","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"You must have some interesting recipes.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You must have some interesting recipes.","TextSheVersion":"You must have some interesting recipes.","TextTheyVersion":"You must have some interesting recipes."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":975.0,"y":175.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26874","byteOffset":18046496,"byteLength":320}},{"id":"DFr_AC16F213","articyId":"72057718591982326","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"You have some strange ideas about flavor, but I am on the lookout for new recipes.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You have some strange ideas about flavor, but I am on the lookout for new recipes.","TextSheVersion":"You have some strange ideas about flavor, but I am on the lookout for new recipes.","TextTheyVersion":"You have some strange ideas about flavor, but I am on the lookout for new recipes."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":975.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43843","byteOffset":30918608,"byteLength":364}},{"id":"DFr_3E88F203","articyId":"72057718591982373","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Any tips on cooking in the LUZ? I'd love some recipes.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Any tips on cooking in the LUZ? I'd love some recipes.","TextSheVersion":"Any tips on cooking in the LUZ? I'd love some recipes.","TextTheyVersion":"Any tips on cooking in the LUZ? I'd love some recipes."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1875.0,"y":175.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19275","byteOffset":15176408,"byteLength":336}},{"id":"DFr_61253C11","articyId":"72057718591982379","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I do have my own place.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I do have my own place.","TextSheVersion":"I do have my own place.","TextTheyVersion":"I do have my own place."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1875.0,"y":725.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37637","byteOffset":28577504,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_659D5589","articyId":"72057718591982386","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"You're right. My apologies.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You're right. My apologies.","TextSheVersion":"You're right. My apologies.","TextTheyVersion":"You're right. My apologies."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1875.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29702","byteOffset":19117544,"byteLength":308}},{"id":"DFr_24674787","articyId":"72057718591982421","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Looks like you're doing ok.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Looks like you're doing ok.","TextSheVersion":"Looks like you're doing ok.","TextTheyVersion":"Looks like you're doing ok."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2475.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49224","byteOffset":32964448,"byteLength":308}},{"id":"DFr_F7B56D64","articyId":"72057718591982440","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"No of course not... I'm just a keen home chef.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"No of course not... I'm just a keen home chef.","TextSheVersion":"No of course not... I'm just a keen home chef.","TextTheyVersion":"No of course not... I'm just a keen home chef."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor"